# MEHFIL — environment variables (copy to .env.local for a live ingestion run).
# Without this key, `npm run ingest` automatically runs offline against fixtures.

# YouTube Data API v3 key (read-only public data; no OAuth needed).
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials and enable
# "YouTube Data API v3". Default quota: 10,000 units/day (resets midnight PT).
